    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so the buyer has the risk once it's on the vessel. what about the documentation? like, besides the insurance policy, what specific documents should the seller be handing over to the buyer to make sure the transition of responsibility is smooth and everything is legal for customs in germany?",
