      "content": "In addition to the insurance policy, the seller should provide the buyer with the following documents to ensure a smooth Customs clearance in Germany: a commercial invoice (FE-certificate), a packing list, a Bill of Lading (B/L), and any other relevant customs documents such as a Certificate of Origin (AFCI - Athenthicmarkt-Dokument). These documents should be provided to the buyer, not just attached to the invoice or shipping documents.",
